This repository dogfoods Forge Memory-First.

At the start of work, read only active `.forge/INTENT.md` and
`.forge/MISSION.md`; run `forge-init` if either is missing. Archives, reviews,
and `forge.db` are opt-in history, not default orientation.

The host executes ordinary tasks directly. Do not automatically delegate,
create review artifacts, run a fixed role/preflight/gate pipeline, or enter
Assurance. Clarify consequential ambiguity; small reversible assumptions may
be made and reported.

Use targeted checks proportional to the change and report exact evidence plus
unchecked boundaries. Only the host writes active control memory.
Use the five checkpoint transitions: user decision, visible delivery, pause,
completion, and mission replacement. Do not checkpoint every step.

Loop and Assurance start only when the user explicitly invokes or requests
them. Task-based capability profiles, when available, are selected by task and
are never a required pipeline.

## 证据纪律
Verification levels: unverified → smoke_verified → locally_verified → reviewed → ci_verified
ci_verified 需要真实 CI 证据；本地测试只到 locally_verified。

## Git 与产品边界
- 未经用户针对本次改动明确要求，不执行 commit 或 push。
- 至少支持 Claude Code + Codex；`SKILL.md` < 500 行；模板保留 frontmatter。
- 不构建 runtime hooks、block graph、确定性传播引擎、多用户同步或 CI 自动部署。
